\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Writing is not triggered by exhausted internal capacity. (A)~Instructed to answer without writing, models collapse after one to two dependent steps; with writing allowed, accuracy stays near ceiling ($n{=}30$ items per depth). (B)~The fraction of intermediate values written is 0.93 to 1.00 at every depth (Wilson intervals); the dashed curve is the onset a capacity-relief account predicts, and it does not appear.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:capacity}{{2}{3}{Writing is not triggered by exhausted internal capacity. (A)~Instructed to answer without writing, models collapse after one to two dependent steps; with writing allowed, accuracy stays near ceiling ($n{=}30$ items per depth). (B)~The fraction of intermediate values written is 0.93 to 1.00 at every depth (Wilson intervals); the dashed curve is the onset a capacity-relief account predicts, and it does not appear}{figure.2}{}}
